OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition at city event  
OL,4,Asees nine arrests                      
OL,6,FOfficers have arrested nine people in  
OL,7,FNottingham city centre after the       
OL,8,Fdeployment of facial recognition       
OL,9,Ftechnology.                            
OL,11,FThe system was unveiled by             
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police in July with the
OL,13,Fpromise it would be used only to check 
OL,14,Fagainst a "watchlist" of potential     
OL,15,Fsuspects, and that any unmatched scans 
OL,16,Fwould be deleted within seconds.       
OL,18,FOfficers said the marked van was used  
OL,19,Fduring the first week of the Winter    
OL,20,FWonderland event, near Old Market      
OL,21,FSquare, from 13 November.              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
