OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition at city event  
OL,4,Asees nine arrests                      
OL,6,FThe technology helped identify nine    
OL,7,Fsuspects, including one who attempted  
OL,8,Fto hide in a McDonald's restaurant     
OL,9,Fafter officers went to follow up the   
OL,10,Fcomputer match. She was caught and     
OL,11,Farrested on suspicion of shop theft.   
